Make the libkyrka python module useful for gospel chats:

  - expose kyrka_cathedral_liturgy(), gospel needs it to tell a cathedral
    which peers it wants and to enumerate the members of a group
  - hand the liturgy peer list, the remembrance cathedrals and the peer
    discovery flags to the python event callback, gospel needs all three
  - pykyrka_version() is METH_NOARGS, its args PRECOND aborted

